{"ticker":"BIIB","updated":"2026-11-27T22:40:56Z","profile":{"longName":"Biogen Inc.","shortName":"Biogen Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","country":"United States","website":"https://www.biogen.com","fullTimeEmployees":7500,"marketCap":39054106624,"trailingPE":114.3723,"forwardPE":16.268303,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.792655,"pegRatio":3.5,"targetMeanPrice":269.1978,"targetHighPrice":350.0,"targetLowPrice":175.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":32,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.106,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.75765,"operatingMargins":0.23504,"profitMargins":0.03375,"totalRevenue":10297299968,"beta":0.086,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":269.89,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":160.36,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Biogen Inc. discovers, develops, manufactures, and delivers therapies in the United States, Europe, Germany, Asia, and internationally. The company provides TECFIDERA, VUMERITY, AVONEX, PLEGRIDY, and TYSABRI for multiple sclerosis (MS); SPINRAZA for spinal muscular atrophy; SKYCLARYS to treat Friedreich's Ataxia; QALSODY for treating amyotrophic lateral sclerosis; FUMADERM to treat plaque psoriasis; BENEPALI, an etanercept biosimilar referencing ENBREL; IMRALDI, an adalimumab biosimilar referencing HUMIRA; FLIXABI, an infliximab biosimilar referencing REMICADE. It offers LEQEMBI for the treatment of Alzheimer's disease; ZURZUVAE for the treatment of postpartum depression; RITUXAN to treat non-Hodgkin's lymphoma, chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL), rheumatoid arthritis, two forms of ANCA-associated vasculitis, and pemphigus vulgaris; RITUXAN HYCELA for non-Hodgkin's lymphoma and CLL; GAZYVA to treat CLL and follicular lymphoma; OCREVUS for relapsing MS and primary progressive MS; LUNSUMIO to treat relapsed or refractory follicular lymphoma; glofitamab for aRelapsed or refractory diffuse large B-cell lymphoma; and other anti-CD20 therapies. Biogen Inc. has collaboration and license agreements with Merz Therapeutics; Alkermes Pharma Ireland Limited; Denali Therapeutics Inc.; UCB; Eisai Co., Ltd.; Genentech, Inc.; Neurimmune SubOne AG; Ionis Pharmaceuticals, Inc.; Samsung Bioepis; ","summary_zh":"Biogen Inc. 在美國、歐洲、德國、亞洲和國際上發現、開發、製造和提供治療方法。該公司提供用於治療多發性硬化症（MS）的TECFIDERA、VUMERITY、AVONEX、PLEGRIDY和TYSABRI； SPINRAZA 治療脊髓性肌萎縮症； SKYCLARYS 治療弗里德賴希共濟失調； QALSODY 用於治療肌萎縮側索硬化症； IMRALDI，一種阿達木單抗生物相似藥，參考 HUMIRA； FLIXABI，一種英夫利西單抗生物相似藥，參考 REMICADE。它提供 LEQEMBI 用於治療阿茲海默症；ZURZUVAE 用於治療產後憂鬱症； RITUXAN 用於治療非何杰金氏淋巴瘤、慢性淋巴細胞白血病 (CLL)、類風濕性關節炎、兩種形式的 ANCA 相關血管炎和尋常型天皰瘡； RITUXAN HYCELA 治療非金淋巴瘤用於治療復發性多發性硬化症和原發性進行性多發性硬化症； LUNSUMIO 治療復發或難治性濾泡性淋巴瘤；格洛菲他單抗用於治療復發性或難治性瀰漫性大 B 細胞淋巴瘤；和其他抗CD20療法。 Biogen Inc. 與 Merz Therapeutics 簽訂了合作和許可協議； Alkermes Pharma 愛爾蘭有限公司；德納利治療公司；聯合銀行；衛材有限公司；基因泰克公司； Neurimmune SubOne AG；伊奧尼斯製藥公司；三星Bioepis；","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 一般","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":137.49,"h":138.8,"l":135.39,"c":138.52,"v":1285500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":138.46,"h":141.04,"l":136.94,"c":140.08,"v":1368900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":140.82,"h":154.44,"l":140.7,"c":154.22,"v":4059900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":154.0,"h":157.85,"l":152.22,"c":155.25,"v":2882300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":156.46,"h":160.2,"l":155.97,"c":159.88,"v":2878800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":159.6,"h":159.7,"l":153.1,"c":154.05,"v":1817900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":154.52,"h":154.57,"l":151.97,"c":152.21,"v":1372500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":152.36,"h":152.36,"l":149.64,"c":150.97,"v":1333300},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":151.37,"h":152.15,"l":148.17,"c":149.61,"v":1600400},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":150.0,"h":150.2,"l":144.74,"c":146.57,"v":1725000},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":146.47,"h":147.56,"l":144.65,"c":144.69,"v":1124300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":144.09,"h":146.88,"l":142.2,"c":145.31,"v":1283400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":144.74,"h":145.19,"l":142.29,"c":143.66,"v":1337200},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":144.05,"h":147.48,"l":141.7,"c":142.26,"v":1469100},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":142.1,"h":144.32,"l":141.67,"c":143.0,"v":1010000},